      "title": "Workflow Quick Guide",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Quick guide\n\nLoad front, left, back, and right images of the same object. Generate an untextured mesh and export it with Save 3D Model.\n\nDownload `hunyuan3d-dit-v2-mv_fp16.safetensors` from the model resource below and place it in `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints`.\n\nURLs are shown as plain text for your security, so you can inspect the full address before opening it.\n\n**Hunyuan nodes and setup**\n```text\nhttps://github.com/defnotkevin/ComfyUI-Hunyuan3d-v2-multiview\n```\n\n**Shape model files**\n```text\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.0_repackaged\n```"
